    "updated_at": "2020-10-31T08:32:01Z",
    "body": "Hi @wardy3 , I have noticed this issue too and it is because pipenv stores the short name of the virtualenv as `(src)` but if you just use the venv module it stores the name as `src`. I used the same fix as you removing the brackets from the format string but I am not sure if we should consider this a bug in starship or an upstream issue with pipenv. ",
