    "updated_at": "2021-04-03T18:14:10Z",
    "body": "Sorry for resurrecting a closed issue, but I have a small difficulty with the workaround proposed by @wardy3 - it removes all parentheses from non-pipenv python virtual environments. Best I can figure is because pipenv uses virtualenv internally (vice venv) it needs to explicitly add parentheses when it specifies the prompt name in the virtual environment's `pyvenv.cfg` file.\r\n\r\nHow do you feel about detecting and trimming the extra parentheses when the `pyvenv.cfg` file is read below? In case you think it's a worthwhile idea I submitted a PR.\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/blob/e19f79bfd3f8c1ce2854be5e76e849966f711a5d/src/modules/python.rs#L107-L113",
